Package: robot-editor
Version: @VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: RobotMotion-Editor <noreply@local>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: nginx (>= 1.18), python3 (>= 3.10), python3-websockets, bash, coreutils
Recommends: iproute2
Provides: robot-bridge, robot-web
Replaces: robot-bridge, robot-web
Conflicts: robot-bridge, robot-web
Description: Robot Motion Editor (bridge service + web frontend, self-contained)
 Installs everything needed on the robot host in one package:
  - TienKung Dex bridge service (ROS 2 / Python) under /opt/robot-editor
  - systemd unit robot-editor.service (not enabled by default)
  - nginx site serving the web editor on port 3000, including the full
    production build and robot model assets (no source checkout required)
 .
 Install:
   sudo apt install ./robot-editor_<version>_<arch>.deb
 Then:
   http://<robot-ip>:3000                     web editor
   sudo systemctl enable --now robot-editor    bridge autostart
